{%- comment -%}
  Size chart for the personalised apparel, rendered inside mk-apparel-personalize (param: chart = tee|sweatshirt|hoodie|uglysweater|uglyhoodie).
  Flat garment measurements from the manufacturers' spec sheets (blanks confirmed via the Printify catalog API):
  Gildan 5000 / 5000B / 18000 / 18000B / 18500 / 18500B, Rabbit Skins 3326, Printify AOP hoodie 450. cm = inches x 2.54, rounded.
{%- endcomment -%}
<details class="mks">
  <summary>Size chart</summary>
  {%- unless chart == 'socks' -%}<p class="mks__how">Measured flat: <b>chest width</b> is armpit to armpit, <b>length</b> is top of the shoulder to the hem (±1″). Tip: lay a favorite top flat and compare. Unisex sizing; between sizes? Size up for a relaxed fit.</p>{%- endunless -%}
  {%- case chart -%}
